rule SpeakMoneyAndDatesForVoice
	statement: In voice, say amounts in rupees with Indian grouping (lakh, crore), round only for speech and never in the source figure, state the date a balance is valid for, and read dates as day, month, year in India time.
	lineageTag: c7f1280d-8d4f-5fac-b3ab-b86ea21d6aec

	ruleReferencedEntity Account
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty PostedBalanceInr

		ruleReferencedProperty BalanceAsOn

	ruleReferencedEntity Transaction
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty PostedDateIst
